# tally 2.3.1 R1, N250.1 (L §5.14 Certainty): a binding without `with uncertain` leaves an unfulfilled movement of
# an uncertain kind out whatever its day, a hole day too, a decision's (nmb, smb) and a plain move's (nmp, smp):
# 0, as every pinned day gives; with uncertain, the hole (nmbu, nmpu). Before: nmb, nmp, smb, smp the hole.
=== b1e.tally
model b1e
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind maybes: event uncertain
  leg cash: PLN
kind mplain: event uncertain
  leg cash: PLN
place sv2: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sv4: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input dm: date
move mb: maybes
  on dm
  reads sv2
  leg cash from sv2 to world amount min(bal(sv2), pay)
move mp: mplain
  on dm
  leg cash from sv4 to world amount pay
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  dm = window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) "c"
  opening[sv2] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[sv4] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
ask nmb: count(t in maybes over 2026-05)
ask nmb_p4: count(t in maybes over 2026-05) with dm = 2026-05-04
ask nmb_p6: count(t in maybes over 2026-05) with dm = 2026-05-06
ask smb: sum(t.cash.amount for t in maybes over 2026-05)
ask nmp: count(t in mplain over 2026-05)
ask nmp_p4: count(t in mplain over 2026-05) with dm = 2026-05-04
ask nmp_p6: count(t in mplain over 2026-05) with dm = 2026-05-06
ask smp: sum(t.cash.amount for t in mplain over 2026-05)
ask nmbu: count(t in maybes over 2026-05) with uncertain
ask nmpu: count(t in mplain over 2026-05) with uncertain
=== expect
nmb: 0
  cut 2026-04-20
nmb_p4: 0
  cut 2026-04-20
nmb_p6: 0
  cut 2026-04-20
nmbu: ?"date within window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) not precise enough for the day of mb" (dm)
  unknown day: dm
  cut 2026-04-20
nmp: 0
  cut 2026-04-20
nmp_p4: 0
  cut 2026-04-20
nmp_p6: 0
  cut 2026-04-20
nmpu: ?"date within window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) not precise enough for the day of mp" (dm)
  unknown day: dm
  cut 2026-04-20
smb: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
smp: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
